cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool, please cite the paper below."
title: "UnifiedBDDLinter"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free linter and form-preserving auto-fixer for Gherkin
  .feature files, implementing 28 rules across Style, Structure, Workflow
  and Quality families. Repairs only defects recoverable from the file
  itself, so a specification is never rewritten to silence a rule.
version: "1.1"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/vaishnavkoka/UnifiedBDDLinter"
type: software
authors:
